{"type":"message","id":"9b9353e8","parentId":"f209d329","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:57:15.892Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-05-21 11:57 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Follow your SOUL to cross-reference multiple RSS feeds, find the single biggest news event, and extract deep facts. Write the aggregated JSON to the file /tmp/crypto-run-20260521-115708/research/raw.json (this path is also available at /tmp/researcher-raw.txt). Do NOT return the JSON in your chat response. Yield back ONLY the word \"SUCCESS\"."}],"timestamp":1779364635883}}
{"type":"message","id":"f7d7ce99","parentId":"9b9353e8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:57:33.994Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7A84BCBINIbazXtfMcRHAFRK","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport subprocess, sys, json, xml.etree.ElementTree as ET, email.utils, datetime, re\nfrom urllib.parse import urlparse\nUA='Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; OpenClawScout/1.0)'\nfeeds=[\n ('CoinDesk','https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/'),\n ('CoinTelegraph','https://cointelegraph.com/rss'),\n ('Decrypt','https://decrypt.co/feed'),\n ('Google News','https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=cryptocurrency+OR+blockchain+OR+ethereum+OR+solana+OR+altcoin+OR+%22digital+assets%22+OR+XRP+OR+cardano+-dogecoin+-shiba+-pepe+-floki+-bonk+-wif+-memecoin+-%22meme+coin%22&hl=en-US&gl=US&ceid=US:en'),\n ('BeInCrypto','https://beincrypto.com/feed/'),\n ('The Block','https://www.theblock.co/rss.xml'),\n ('CryptoSlate','https://cryptoslate.com/feed/'),\n ('CryptoFox Markets','https://cryptofox.news/rss/markets/'),\n ('CryptoFox Regulation','https://cryptofox.news/rss/regulation/'),\n]\nnow=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc)\ncutoff=now-datetime.timedelta(hours=24)\nfor name,url in feeds:\n    try:\n        xml=subprocess.check_output(['curl','-sL','-A',UA,url,'--max-time','12'], text=True)\n        status='ok'\n        if not xml.strip():\n            print(f'## {name} EMPTY')\n            continue\n        # very lightweight parser\n        try:\n            root=ET.fromstring(xml)\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f'## {name} PARSE_ERROR {e}')\n            continue\n        items=[]\n        # rss and atom support\n        for item in root.findall('.//item')[:50]:\n            title=(item.findtext('title') or '').strip()\n            link=(item.findtext('link') or '').strip()\n            pub=(item.findtext('pubDate') or item.findtext('{http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/}date') or '').strip()\n            desc=(item.findtext('description') or '').strip()\n            items.append((title,link,pub,desc))\n        if not items:\n            ns={'atom':'http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom'}\n            for entry in root.findall('.//atom:entry',ns)[:50]:\n                title=(entry.findtext('atom:title',default='',namespaces=ns) or '').strip()\n                link=''\n                l=entry.find('atom:link',ns)\n                if l is not None:\n                    link=(l.get('href') or '').strip()\n                pub=(entry.findtext('atom:updated',default='',namespaces=ns) or entry.findtext('atom:published',default='',namespaces=ns) or '').strip()\n                desc=(entry.findtext('atom:summary',default='',namespaces=ns) or '').strip()\n                items.append((title,link,pub,desc))\n        print(f'## {name}')\n        count=0\n        for title,link,pub,desc in items:\n            dt=None\n            if pub:\n                try:\n                    dt=email.utils.parsedate_to_datetime(pub)\n                except Exception:\n                    try:\n                        dt=datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(pub.replace('Z','+00:00'))\n                    except Exception:\n                        dt=None\n            if dt is not None and dt.tzinfo is None:\n                dt=dt.replace(tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\n            if dt and dt>=cutoff:\n                print(json.dumps({'title':title,'link':link,'pub':dt.astimezone(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'desc':re.sub(r'<[^>]+>',' ',desc)[:180]},ensure_ascii=False))\n                count+=1\n                if count>=12:\n                    break\n        if count==0:\n            print('(no items in last 24h among first 50 entries)')\n    except subprocess.CalledProcessError as e:\n        print(f'## {name} FETCH_ERROR {e}')\nPY","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9229,"output":1440,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10669,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779364635895,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhwJZWsR3JS7P6PcuZ8jhrh7RNjuK"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4d476dba","parentId":"f7d7ce99","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:57:41.833Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7A84BCBINIbazXtfMcRHAFRK","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## CoinDesk\n{\"title\": \"It's not all HYPE: Privacy and quantum-resistant coins advance as bitcoin marks time\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/daybook-us/2026/05/21/it-s-not-all-hype-privacy-and-quantum-resistant-coins-surge-as-bitcoin-marks-time\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T11:21:25+00:00\", \"desc\": \"Your day-ahead look for May 21, 2026\"}\n{\"title\": \"The $6 billion expiration countdown: Traders pile into $82,000 bitcoin calls ahead of May 29 expiry\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/bitcoin-caught-between-usd75-000-max-pain-and-usd80-000-call-wall-ahead-of-usd6-25-billion-expiry\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T10:53:05+00:00\", \"desc\": \"Deribit’s bitcoin open interest has overtaken BlackRock’s IBIT as traders brace for a showdown between $75K max pain and $80K call positioning.\"}\n{\"title\": \"HYPE leads crypto rebound as traders position for volatility breakout\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/hype-leads-crypto-rebound-as-traders-position-for-volatility-breakout\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T10:52:57+00:00\", \"desc\": \"Bitcoin and ether stabilized as derivatives activity rebounded, HYPE rose for a fifth straight day and options traders positioned for a breakout.\"}\n{\"title\": \"A crypto whale has made a $224,000 bet that XRP's price stays perfectly flat through June\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/a-massive-xrp-trade-is-betting-prices-gravitate-to-usd1-40-until-the-end-of-june\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T09:34:48+00:00\", \"desc\": \"The trader collected about $224,500 in premiums and will keep the full amount if XRP remains close to $1.40.\"}\n{\"title\": \"TradFi giant IG to expand crypto trading across Europe through Bitpanda\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/20/tradfi-giant-ig-to-expand-crypto-trading-across-europe-through-bitpanda\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T08:58:31+00:00\", \"desc\": \"The London-listed company is broadening its digital asset offering after introducing spot crypto trading for U.K. retail customers last year.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Binance launches SpaceX pre-IPO perps amid $2 trillion valuation bets\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/binance-launches-spacex-pre-ipo-perps\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T07:03:20+00:00\", \"desc\": \"Binance looks to democratize pre-IPO markets, starting with SpaceX perpetual futures.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Don't call us just a WLFI treasury company, says AI Financial\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/don-t-call-us-just-a-wlfi-treasury-company-says-ai-financial\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T05:20:35+00:00\", \"desc\": \"The company says it is building a broader fintech, tokenization and digital infrastructure business, but its latest SEC filing shows WLFI still dominates the balance sheet.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Here's why bitcoin turned lower from the 200-day average\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/bitcoin-s-rebound-has-a-buyer-problem-as-etf-coinbase-and-korea-demand-fade\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T04:52:32+00:00\", \"desc\": \"BTC recently turned lower from the 200-day average, a barometer of long-term trends. CryptoQuant explains why.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Polymarket moves to list parlays while SEC seeks public input on prediction market ETFs\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/20/polymarket-moves-to-list-parlays-while-sec-seeks-public-input-on-prediction-market-etfs\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-20T22:55:53+00:00\", \"desc\": \"The \\\"combinatorial outcome contracts\\\" would resolve if every part of an underlying contract resolved, according to a filing.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Bitcoin miners tied to AI rise as Nvidia posts big earnings beat and strong outlook\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/20/bitcoin-miners-rise-as-nvidia-posts-blowout-earnings-and-strong-outlook\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-20T22:22:52+00:00\", \"desc\": \"Nvidia's stronger-than-expected results and bullish AI outlook lifted crypto mining stocks tied to data center and high-performance computing demand, even as the chipmaker's shares\"}\n{\"title\": \"Federal Reserve proposes limited master accounts long pursued by crypto firms\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/20/federal-reserve-proposes-limited-master-accounts-long-pursued-by-crypto-firms\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-20T22:11:10+00:00\", \"desc\": \"The U.S. Fed issued a revised proposal on the structure of payment accounts, taking the next step to build on an earlier pitch for so-called skinny accounts.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Elon Musk's SpaceX held 18,712 bitcoin at fair value of $1.29 billion at end of Q1, IPO filing shows\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/20/elon-musk-s-spacex-holds-18-712-bitcoin-at-fair-value-of-usd1-29-billion-ipo-filing-shows\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-20T21:32:50+00:00\", \"desc\": \"The rocket and satellite company is looking to go public at a valuation of more than $1.5 trillion.\"}\n## CoinTelegraph\n{\"title\": \"OSL Strengthens Asia’s Digital Asset Ecosystem with Listing of State-Supervised Gold-Backed Stablecoin USDKG\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/osl-strengthens-asias-digital-asset-ecosystem-with-listing-of-state-supervised-gold-backed-stablecoin-usdkg?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T10:28:20+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    OSL Group (863.HK) (OSL), a global stablecoin payment and trading platform, today announced that its Hong Kong-licensed digital asset exchange OSL HK has officially listed USDK\"}\n{\"title\": \"Silvergate’s Fraher breaks silence on settlement with Gensler’s SEC\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/silvergates-fraher-breaks-silence-on-settlement-with-genslers-sec?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T07:38:46+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    Former Silvergate executive Kate Fraher said the rule that prevented her from sharing her side of the story was unconstitutional. It was finally lifted by the SEC this week. \"}\n{\"title\": \"Tax evaders are trying ‘novel digital assets’ to dodge authorities: Chainalysis\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/criminals-attempt-to-use-bitcoin-ordinals-to-evade-authorities-chainalysis?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T07:34:52+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    Italian authorities uncovered a tax evasion scheme in which an individual allegedly used Bitcoin Ordinals and the BRC-20 token standard to generate and conceal $1.1 million. \\n \"}\n{\"title\": \"Syndicate Labs winds down after 5 years, citing shrinking rollup market\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-infrastructure-firm-syndicate-labs-closes-citing-shift-in-rollup-market?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T07:30:06+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    The Ethereum rollup market is dominated by Arbitrum and Base, which have a combined 68% market share, according to L2Beat. \\n \"}\n{\"title\": \"SEC seeks public comment as it weighs prediction market ETFs\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-seeks-public-comment-as-it-weighs-prediction-market-etfs?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T05:44:37+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    Bitwise, Roundhill Investments and GraniteShares had their prediction market ETF applications put on hold by the SEC earlier this month. \"}\n{\"title\": \"Hyperliquid ETFs surprise with 50% volume jump after slow launch\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/hyperliquid-etfs-see-50-volume-jump-with-perfectly-timed-launch?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T04:36:42+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    ETF analyst Eric Balchunas says crypto and traditional assets are trading down while Hyperliquid is up, leading to a boon for ETFs tied to the token. \"}\n{\"title\": \"Map Protocol token plummets 96% after a quadrillion token mint exploit\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/map-protocol-loses-96-of-its-value-after-quadrillion-token-mint-exploit?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T04:35:52+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    The attacker tricked the Butter Network cross-chain bridge into minting millions more tokens than the legitimate supply of MAPO. \\n \"}\n{\"title\": \"Bitcoin treasury Nakamoto plans reverse stock split to save ailing share price\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/nakamoto-1-for-40-reverse-stock-split-nasdaq-bitcoin-treasury?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T04:30:53+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    Shares in Nakamoto closed Wednesday at 16 cents. They are down more than 99% from May last year, when the stock traded above $25.  \"}\n{\"title\": \"SpaceX reveals larger-than-expected Bitcoin holdings in IPO filing\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/spacex-filing-reveals-larger-than-expected-bitcoin-holdings-ahead-of-ipo?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T02:08:30+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    SpaceX is expected to go public next month, which would make its 18,712 Bitcoin holdings rank seventh among public companies. \"}\n{\"title\": \"Key Bitcoin price metric used by bulls falls to six-week low, but there’s a silver lining\", \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-coinbase-premium-slidse-to-six-week-lows-but-there-is-a-silver-lining?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\", \"pub\": \"2026-05-20T22:53:48+00:00\", \"desc\": \"    Profit-taking by 